Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Yugi-Moto\Nagreed to give up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters forever if\Nhe loses at this new game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, especially since Dungeon Dice\NMonsters is a game his opponent invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel's best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's lost now. He's Duke's pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumbest dog you've ever met!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it's a rabbit-dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to get him a muzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, that won't\Nbe necessary, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't y 'all just go back to cheering\Nfor your little dookie over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.77,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll even start you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, Duke, he's so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait till Yugi\Nwins this and gets Joey out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,of that stupid dog suit Duke\NDevlin's making him wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's a real jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Duke's all about humiliating\Nhis opponents, especially Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would he want to beat him\Nin a game broadcast around the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.39,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on a vendetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He blames Yugi for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is game not taking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing Pegasus as his business partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just wrong. You! Come on, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you just gotta win this\Nmatch and get me out of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,this fleabag costume before\NI completely lose it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Down, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... not... a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could just play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, those cheerleaders sure\Nknow how to yank Joey's chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, at least they haven't\Nreduced him to howling yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not housebreaking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's monsters have already taken\Nout one of my three heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless I do something right\Nhere, they'll take out another.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make this turn count.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I just found\Nwhat I needed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get some Magic Crests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I may not be able\Nto win Joey his freedom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And another.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Two out of three. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears I've rolled\Ntwo Magic Crests, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But since both have times two multiplier\Nemblems, each of their values are doubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me four Magic Crests,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,more than enough to activate\NThunderball's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've even learned how to\Nuse your help screen to find
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,out how to activate the\Nmonster's special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll use three of the crests I rolled\Nand activate Thunderball's special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Rolling Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blast lizard is\Nabout to be bowled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But my attack will not end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use three more Magic\NCrests I saved in my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Crest Pool and have\NThunderball strike again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gator Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You nailed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to pick up the spare, Yook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cool! Let me see! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That new store certainly\Nhas a crowd today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder just what my\Ncompetition is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Age before beauty is coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Marvelous. Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful even.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what I wouldn't give\Nfor a TV of this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They take my business,\Nbut my grandson, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's here to watch\Nthe back your head, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it or lose it, Popsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.21,0:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You used that help screen to come up\Nwith a pretty impressive move there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I wouldn't get any\Nideas about winning this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never know Dice\NMonsters as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the guy\Nwho invented the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as your idol Pegasus invented\Nthe Duel Monsters card game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But inventing a game doesn't mean that\Nyou can't be beaten at it, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps my beating Pegasus\Nwas the exception to the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You only beat Pegasus by cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try and fool me. No, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fooling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save those in my crest pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn, Duke. Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi! Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Two summons and a movement crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.65,0:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, behold the monster\Nthat I've unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've summoned the Knight of Twin Swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the good it'll do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my monsters are within\Nstriking distance of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'll store my other\Ndie in my crest pool for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, at least you've become\Nskilled at conserving your crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, crest this, crest that, I'm\Ntotally lost. Guess it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can't teach\Nan old dog new tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dog boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dungeon Dice rules number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're allowed to take the crest you roll,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,store them in your crest pool,\Nand then use them later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that rule now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate on dog rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna learn, learn\Nhow to obey our commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, sit, dog boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, that's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dog's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There Yugi goes again,\Nscouring that help screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's certainly a quick study.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of the things he's learned in\Nminutes took me weeks to come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to take things up a notch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have just the\Ndice to do it with, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of summoning crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And unlock my creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here's a monster your knight will\Ndefinitely want to steer clear of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle Ox!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you may have a hard time\Navoiding him once I use these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,four stored movement press and\Nhave him charge in for an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes, Yugi, invading your turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you better believe this\Nbull knows how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Battle Ox, go for the\NKnight of Twin Swords, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,my ox gains a ten-point bonus when\Nattacking all warrior-type creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,like your knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, switch into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:07:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Devlin, but in defense mode,\Nmy knight has a defense power of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning that your ox's attack\Nwill only do 20 points of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll lose 20 of his 30 hit\Npoints from your ox's attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll still remain on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That cheat has taught\Nhimself how to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm activating my knight's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,By using both these\Nattack crests, now he's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,allowed to attack you\Ntwice in one turn And
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,make two assaults on\Nyour beast's hit points
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go double slash attack
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Duke Your ox has been gored
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my ox. That knight\Nslaughtered him. No, Dookie-Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really on a roll now, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Great move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Duke, but this time you might\Nwant to steer clear of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were able to defeat\Nmy battle-ox, Yugi. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My last brilliant move wasn't about\Njust creating another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was about building out my dungeon path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at your\Ndungeon path, you dunce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been stopped dead in its tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,See my red dungeon path?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see how it reaches from one side of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the board all the way across to the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,creating one solid line in\Nfront of your blue path?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess what, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dungeon path can't cross it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means that\Nyour monsters can't get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to my heart points on\Nthe other side of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stuck, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't build your dungeon\Npath forward anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're completely boxed in. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trapped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's laid out his dungeon path so it\Ncompletely blocked my ability to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I am trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow it myself, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain one last time. It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My red dungeon path extends from one side\Nof the board all the way to the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, since one dungeon\Npath can't overlap another,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi's blue path is behind my red one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can no longer continue\Nto build his path forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if all of Yugi's monsters\Nare stuck behind that dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they can't get to Duke's life\Npoints, and that would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'm stuck in his costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that the so-called\Nking of games over there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is about to be forced\Ninto an early retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some\Nway Yugi can still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:10:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi could always try cruising his\Nmonsters through my dungeon path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He can move through your path?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,if he doesn't mind running his\Nmonsters through a virtual gauntlet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,because to get to my heart points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll have to survive every one of\Nmy monsters that he meets on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But then that means all his\Nmonsters would get pulverized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My roll now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what this is, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a black dye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A very rare black dye, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it, I'm going to finish\Nyou off and win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see the power\Nof the rare black dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Yugi going to\Nhave to contend with now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warp Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to explain this now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark hole you see\Nbefore you is a special
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,summoning that only a rare\Nblack dye can produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cosmic portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When monsters jump into it, they're sent\Nto another place on the board instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This other place is determined by\Nwherever the second vortex is laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the monster pops out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes two vortexes to complete\Nthe circuit, creating a warp tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess what, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already got the second\Nlocation all picked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep within your territory\Nand well behind your defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect spot for easy access\Nto your heart points. Now, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,all that stands between you\Nand defeat is the time that it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,takes for my automator to spit\Nout the next rare black die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling it won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So start working on\Nyour retirement speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to try\Nand build up my defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Two summons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good roll, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Devlin, let's see how\Nwell I've learned your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Stripe Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,His high speed allows him to move\Nthree spaces for each movement crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,High speed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but he doesn't come close to the\Nwarp speed that my vortex will give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, check out this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my second black dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll roll to complete the warp tube\Nand then finish you off for good. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If he summons another\NWarp Vortex, I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If Duke summons that Warp\NVortex, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the faith, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No Warp Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You lucked out this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Devlin, I've just found a\Nmajor hole in your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Or if you prefer, a vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A black die? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of summoning crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I place a second warp vortex so that\NI have easy access to your heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike ninja, jump into the warp vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That strike ninja really is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's gone into the warp hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come out on your side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Strike Ninja, attack\Nand destroy his Ryukushin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth slash attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Yugi, Yugi, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke may have blocked\Nme from being able to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,extend my dungeon path\Nto his heart points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to the Warp Vortex he placed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I now have an even better way of\Ngetting my monsters over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His portal became my way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Yugi got a rare black die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's using the Warp\NVortex I summon against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that high-speed strike\Nninja already deep in my territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,all Yugi has to do is\Nroll one movement press,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll be able to move him with\Nits striking range of my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop it. Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need two summon crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My roll failed me. Go! Dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A set of movement crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike ninja! Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I love watching this dude run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, strike ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his heart point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunging claw thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My hard point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, and two to go! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my grandson!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just been so long since anyone's\Ndestroyed one of my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really give\Nyourself a pat on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I guarantee you, it's\Nnot going to be happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A level three summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice, and unlock\Nmy undefeatable monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Orgoth the Relentless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And next,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use two Magic crests and\Nactivate Orgoth the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Relentless's special attack to\Nraise his power from 20 to 30!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:17:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use two of my stored movement crest\Ndice and position Orgoth for attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth the Relentless,\Nattack! Strike, ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamond, blade, strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better think fast if\NI want to save my ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ninja has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure if I were you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a closer look, Devlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,In the smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strike Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Duke, but just before\NOrgot the Relentless attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I activated my ninja's special\Nability with a Storg Trap Crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows him to quickly dodge any attack\Nthat's waged against him and escape arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Yugi has taught himself\Nsuch an advanced defense maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:19:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he's making me look like a novice at my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Own game. I can't let\Nhim rattle me. Have to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,remember that this kid is just a lousy\Ncheat he doesn't have the skills to win this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,match it's my role now Duke and now I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,can attack again strike ninja lunging claw
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,thrust no not another one of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Two down now. I believe\NI've taken the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.13,0:19:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Devlin, you little wannabe. I swore\NI'd have my revenge on you for cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus and sabotaging my game and I will
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,go dice roll now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth, show that ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,why you're called relentless oh no I\Ndon't have any more traps in my crest pool
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way for me to help my ninja\Nescape this time diamond Dragon Blade Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His ninja's been wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.37,0:20:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You were close, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Closer than anyone I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid that close doesn't\Ncut it in Dungeon Dice Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you may have one heart point more\Nthan me, but I have Orgoth the Relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and none of your monsters will stop\Nhim from getting to your heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been on the victory trail,\NYugi, but now you're at a dead end!
